{
  "key": 25726,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Apparently, there is an odd tree\n",
        "on Route 36.\r",
        "They say it dances when you\n",
        "water it...\r",
        "Oh, of course not!\r",
        "This is a Flower Shop, so we do have\n",
        "watering cans and things like that...\r",
        "But I cannot let you have one!\n",
        "It’s too dangerous!\f",
        "Hmmm...\r",
        "Well, maybe if you manage to defeat\n",
        "the Goldenrod Gym Leader, it might\f",
        "be OK..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Apparently, there is an odd tree\n",
        "on Route 36.\r",
        "They say it dances when you water it...\r",
        "Oh, that’s a Plain Badge from\n",
        "Goldenrod Gym!\r",
        "Did you defeat Whitney?!\n",
        "Well, then there’s nothing to worry\f",
        "about, is there?\r",
        "I’ll let you use this SquirtBottle for\n",
        "a while then... Oh, never mind.\f",
        "Keep it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "The odd tree is on Route 36.\n",
        "Please be careful!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Lalala lalalala.\n",
        "Have plenty of water, my lovely!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you using the Berry Pots?\r",
        "You can pick any of the Berries you\n",
        "have planted.\r",
        "Don’t forget to water them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "How...\n",
        "...\f",
        "...\f",
        "...\f",
        "cute!\r",
        "Where did you get that...\n",
        "oh-so-cute Pokémon?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "SHAYMIN, is it?\n",
        "It’s so cute!\r",
        "I know!\r",
        "Let me give it a flower!\n",
        "I have just the one for it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gracidea will look perfect on\n",
        "SHAYMIN!\f",
        "Put it on SHAYMIN in the daylight."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Mulch!\n",
        "Anyone want Mulch?\r",
        "Berries love Mulch.\n",
        "It makes Berries grow faster!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} is a mix of\n",
        "high-quality soil and Pokémon’s...\f",
        "er...you know...\r",
        "It’s full of nutrients!\n",
        "Berries will surely benefit from it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you.\n",
        "Please come again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00011",
      "en_US": "You bought the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Ouch!\n",
        "Your Bag is full!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0589_T25R0601_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Well... Excuse me, but\n",
        "you’re short of money."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
